# No new Java Swing UI

This repo is rewriting the UI to React (`frontend/`). Swing in `kse/` is **reference**, not the place to add screens.

## Do not

- Add or extend `JFrame`, `JDialog`, `JPanel` flows, or new `org.kse.gui.actions.*Action` classes for user-facing features
- Add menu items in `KseFrame` for new React-only behavior
- Port React work back into Swing

## Do

- **Read** `kse/` (actions, dialogs, history) for discovery, YAML, and kernel/session shapes
- Put all new UI in `frontend/`
- Bugfix-only Swing changes require an explicit human request and must not expand UI surface

Crypto/unit-test Java under `kse/src/test` may still change when asked; that is not new UI.
